iOS leaves some trait numbers out of CTFont traits: Helvetica and Arial lack them entirely, some CJK fallback faces lack the slant. font-kit's Font::properties() unwraps all four, so load_family skipped those faces ("failed to resolve font 'Arial'") and is_italic panicked during layout. Read the italic bit and the traits with defaults (font_properties) instead. macOS faces report every trait, so their result is unchanged.

